WEBVTT

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.500
Abis ini ke mana?

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.600
Ya... ke mana lagi?

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.500
Eh, lihat deh.

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:08.000
Apaan?

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.500
Ini rebutan wilayah gitu?

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:13.100
Iya. Siapa yang dapat paling banyak.

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:14.980
- Yang deket dulu aja ya?
- Boleh.

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:16.150
Kita mau ke mana dulu?

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.530
Udah, ikut gua aja.

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:19.000
Oke, gas.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:20.850
Eh, bagus juga ya dari sini.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:22.670
Lo malah foto-foto.

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:24.300
Bentar, gue check-in dulu.

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:26.670
Challenge-nya apaan?

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:28.100
Abis ini lewat sini aja.

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:30.800
Nah, dapet!

00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:32.550
Ya, foto aja.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.300
Udah, gue kirim ya.

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:37.750
Eh, mereka udah dua zona!

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:39.650
Serius? Kita baru satu?

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:41.550
Iya! Ayo, harus ngejar nih.

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:43.050
Yang duduk juga dihitung, kan?

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.600
Yah, salah!

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.900
Bentar! Sarinah bisa direbut!

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:49.300
Deket dong dari sini!

00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:51.400
- Kita masih punya Poin Ganda!
- Gas!

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:53.450
Dapet!

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:54.850
Gue pake Poin Ganda ya.

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:56.950
Yes! Kita unggul!

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:05.750
Minggu depan main lagi, yuk.

00:01:06.430 --> 00:01:08.500
Gas. Tapi gue mau rematch.

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:10.500
Masih nggak terima ya?

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:12.500
Gue masuk nggak?

00:01:12.830 --> 00:01:14.730
Satu... dua... tiga.
